        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bël kɛmɛkä ro̱mä",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Kuoth Nhial Muthɛ jiök i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nɛn ɛ, ɣän cä Be-dha-lel in la gat Uri, Uri in la gat Ɣur, raan döör Juda cɔl ni cio̱tdä, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä cä jɛ thiäŋ kɛ yiëëdä in gɔaa in rɛl rɔ. Cä jɛ ka̱m pɛl kɛnɛ ŋäc ŋɔaani, kɛ tiit kä ŋɔaani amäni ca̱a̱p kuurä diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö bɛ ca̱a̱p kuurä la̱t kɛ la̱t dääpä kɛnɛ la̱t cikä min bo̱r, kɛ la̱t min yian, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ wuɔ̱ɔ̱k guiiyni kɛnɛ wuɔ̱r dɔ̱a̱kni, kɛ ŋa̱t jiɛn, amäni ca̱a̱p kuurä lätni diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nɛn ɛ, ɣän cä jɛ kuany kɛɛl kɛnɛ Ɔ-li-yab in la gat A-ɣi-tha-mak, raan döör Daan. Kä ɣän cä ji̱ kuurä diaal tin pɛl ka̱m ca̱a̱p be̱e̱lä diaal kɛ ɣöö bikɛ tin cä la̱r i̱ la̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala ge̱e̱l duëël ro̱mä nath kɛ Kuoth Nhial kɛnɛ thanduk lueekni kɛnɛ kum wecdɛ min la duŋ kɔ̱cä lɔaac, amäni kuak duëël ro̱mä diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ tharbët kɛnɛ kuakɛ kɛ min la lɛmbärni a cuɔ̱ŋkɛ wi̱i̱dɛ amäni kuakɛ diaal, kɛ yi̱k in la wäl mi ŋuäny gɔaa a waŋkɛ thi̱n, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amäni yi̱k luur tin lap waŋkɛ, kɛ kuakɛ diaal, kɛnɛ thak la̱k te̱tni kɛnɛ ciökɛ kɛ tharɛ min la cuŋ kɛ jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛnɛ bieyni tin ca ta̱kdiɛn thi̱n, kɛnɛ bieyni Kuɔth ti ɣɛ̈lkɛ rɔ̱ kɛ kui̱ Ä-ron in la bo̱o̱th ŋuɔ̱tni, kɛnɛ bieyni gankɛ, kɛ kui̱ la̱t gua̱n kua̱r ŋuɔ̱tnikä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ liɛɛth yi̱rä Kuɔth, kɛ wal ŋuänyä tin gɔw tin la tuɔ̱ɔ̱lkɛ ni gua̱a̱th Kuɔth in thɛ̈kɛ. Bikɛ ti̱ti̱ diaal la̱t ce̱tnikɛ min cä la̱r ji̱.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋuɔ̱t ca̱ŋ lɔ̱ŋä Kuɔth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial Muthɛ jiök i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Läri jɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl i̱, ‘Yuɔpɛ ni̱n lɔ̱ŋädä, kɛ ɣöö nɔmɔ ɛ nyuth kamdä kɔnɛ yɛ ri̱cnikun diaal, kɛ ɣöö bia jɛ ŋa̱c i̱, ɣän Kuoth Nhial, ɛ ɣän jak yɛ kä lɛ̈y lɛ̈ɛ̈y ɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bia cäŋ lɔ̱ŋä a yuɔpɛ, kɛ ɣöö ɛ cäŋ Kuɔth mi gɔaa mi rɛl rɔ kä yɛ. Ram mi wä jɛ ya̱r duundɛ ɣöö ba näk, kä ram mi wä la̱t wä la̱t kɛ jɛn cäŋ ɛmɔ ba jɛ ŋuɔk raar rɛy nɛɛnikɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bi naath lät kɛ ni̱n bäkɛl, kä bärɔw ni̱ni ɛ cäŋ lɔ̱ŋä mi ca gok ni bum, ɛ cäŋ lɔ̱ŋä mi gɔaa mi rɛl rɔ kä Kuoth Nhial. Ram mi wä la̱t la̱t thi̱n duundɛ lia̱a̱. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ, bi ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl jɛ a yoop, tiɛtdɛ cäŋ lɔ̱ŋä ala gok mi do̱raar ri̱cnikiɛn diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba nyuth mi bi a do̱raar kamdä kɔnɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl ɛn ɣöö ɣän Kuoth Nhial cua nhial kɛnɛ piny cak kɛ ni̱n bäkɛl, kä cua lɔ̱ɔ̱ŋ kɛ bärɔwdiɛn, a bi yiëëdä wee ɣa̱a̱c.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ Muthɛ ka̱m pääm da̱ŋ rɛw ti pat paat ti ca lueek gɔ̱a̱r thi̱n guäth ëë cɛ thuɔ̱k kɛ ruac wi̱i̱ Pa̱a̱m Thi-nay, pääm ti gɔ̱r ni Kuoth kɛ yiatdɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
